<p>Containment: Uncontained. MTF-ε neutralise sightings. Pacifistic.</p>
<p>Visual/audio information brief. Level-4 clearance.</p>
<p>Description: Sentient dental quadruped. 194 multi-continental sightings post-1886.</p>
<p>Extensive documents describing SCP-XXXX become teeth. Damages documentation. Determinable image/word count defines transformation. Nomenclative manipulation ineffective.</p>
<p>Neutralisation probable. Previous 158 neutralisations ineffective, involving serious dental violence, internal bleeding, [REDACTED]. ██ MTF-ε agents missing. █ psychosis.</p>
